# Billing

## Mục tiêu

Billing là hệ thống quản lý subscription, payments, và invoices cho SaaS applications. Trong Cursor Enterprise Framework, Billing rule định nghĩa các nguyên tắc và best practices cho việc implement một billing system hoàn chỉnh bao gồm subscription management, payment processing, usage-based billing, invoice generation, và revenue recognition. Mục tiêu là tạo ra một hệ thống billing linh hoạt, reliable, và compliant với financial regulations.

Billing là một trong những critical systems trong SaaS, đòi hỏi careful attention đến accuracy, reliability, và compliance. Một billing error có thể dẫn đến revenue loss, customer churn, và legal issues. Rule này cover subscription lifecycle, payment flows, billing operations, và financial reporting.

## Nguyên tắc

**1. Subscription Lifecycle**

Manage subscription states: trial, active, past_due, canceled, paused. Handle plan changes mid-cycle. Process renewals automatically. Handle expiration gracefully. Plan downgrade/upgrades. Support subscription pause/resume.

**2. Plan và Pricing**

Support multiple pricing models. Flat rate plans. Usage-based pricing. Tiered pricing. Per-seat pricing. Custom enterprise plans. Prorated calculations.

**3. Payment Processing**

Integrate with payment providers. Stripe, Braintree, or internal. Tokenization for card storage. Automatic payment retry. Handle payment failures. Payment method management.

**4. Billing Operations**

Invoice generation. Automated billing cycles. Payment collection. Late fee handling. Credit management. Refund processing. Dispute handling.

**5. Usage Tracking**

Track metered usage. Metered billing integration. Usage aggregation. Usage rollup. Overage handling. Usage reports.

**6. Revenue Recognition**

ASC 606 / IFRS 15 compliance. Recognize revenue over time. Track deferred revenue. Generate revenue reports. Audit trail. Period allocation.

**7. Dunning Management**

Payment failure notifications. Retry schedules. Grace periods. Escalation procedures. Account suspension. Recovery campaigns.

**8. Security và Compliance**

PCI DSS compliance for payment data. SOC 2 controls. Data encryption. Audit logging. Access controls. Financial reporting controls.

**9. Tax Handling**

Tax calculation. Tax jurisdiction. VAT/GST handling. Tax nexus awareness. Automatic tax filing. Tax document generation.

**10. Financial Reporting**

Revenue analytics. MRR/ARR tracking. Churn analysis. LTV calculation. Cohort analysis. Financial statements.

